┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     SENTINEL API                                │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  GET  /health              → Health check                       │
│                                                                 │
│  GET  /api/pods            → List all pods with scores          │
│  GET  /api/pods/:id        → Get pod details + events           │
│  GET  /api/pods/:id/baseline → Get baseline snapshot            │
│  GET  /api/pods/:id/events → Get drift events                   │
│  GET  /api/pods/:id/history → Get score history                 │
│  DELETE /api/pods/:id      → Trigger pod purge                  │
│                                                                 │
│  GET  /api/leaderboard     → Pods sorted by score               │
│  GET  /api/stats           → Cluster statistics                 │
│  GET  /api/events          → Recent drift events                │
│                                                                 │
│  GET  /api/config          → Get purge configuration            │
│  PUT  /api/config          → Update purge configuration         │
│                                                                 │
│  POST /api/baselines       → Receive baseline (from agent)      │
│  POST /api/drift           → Receive drift events (from agent)  │
│  POST /api/scores          → Receive score updates (from agent) │
│  POST /api/pods/removed    → Pod removal notification           │
│                                                                 │
│  WS   /api/ws/scores       → Real-time score stream             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
